flowchart LR
  User[User / Client] -->|HTTP (POST/GET)| Frontend[Browser / Client]
  Frontend -->|requests| FastAPI[FastAPI app\n(main.py)]

  subgraph API[Application]
    direction TB
    Router[APIRouter (routes.py)]
    Router --> Generate[/POST /generate]
    Router --> GenerateImages[/POST /generate-images]
    Router --> Describe[/POST /describe-images]
    Router --> ServeImage[/GET /images/{filename}]
    Router --> Export[/GET /exports/{filename}]
  end

  FastAPI --> Router

  subgraph Backend[Services]
    direction LR
    GeminiClient[gemini_client.py\n(select_text_model, generate, describe_image)]
    ImageGen[image_generator.py\n(generate_paired_images)]
    Parser[parser.py\n(extract_three_stimuli, parse_sentences)]
    Logger[logger.py\n(session_scope, current_session)]
    Prompt[system_prompt.py / image_system_prompt.py]
  end

  Generate -->|build prompt via| Prompt
  Generate -->|call| GeminiClient
  GeminiClient -->|text output| Parser
  Parser -->|validated stimuli| Router
  Generate -->|log & export| Logs[generation_log.jsonl / exports/]

  GenerateImages -->|generate stimuli (text)| GeminiClient
  GenerateImages -->|nc/vc sentences| ImageGen
  ImageGen -->|call image model| GeminiClient
  ImageGen -->|save images| FS[generated_images/]
  GenerateImages -->|log & export| Logs
  ServeImage --> FS
  Export --> FS

  Describe -->|save uploads| Uploads[uploaded_images/]
  Describe -->|parallel calls| GeminiClient
  GeminiClient -->|descriptions| SSE[Server-Sent Events stream]
  SSE --> Frontend
  Describe -->|save descriptions| Uploads

  subgraph Storage[File system]
    exports_dir[exports/]
    gen_images[generated_images/]
    uploads[uploaded_images/]
    logs[generation_log.jsonl\nstimuli_log.jsonl\nimage_gen_timings.jsonl]
  end

  Logs --> logs
  FS --> gen_images
  Uploads --> uploads
  Router -->|write| exports_dir

  note right of GeminiClient: Model selection + fallback
  note left of ImageGen: Multi‑step paired image pipeline
  note bottom of Router: GEMINI_HARD_TIMEOUT_S and session logging
